# Under Deno (no package.json), Vite keeps its cache — including basic-ssl's
# generated dev certificate and key — in .vite/ rather than node_modules/.vite,
# and bundles the config to a temp file beside vite.config.ts. Both must stay
# out of git, and out of the build-id dirty check.
.vite/
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*.mjs
